WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.281 --> 00:00:12.091
The summary line records how many genes went in, the organism and the cutoff.

2
00:00:12.091 --> 00:00:20.714
Each tab is one database. The table lists the enriched terms, most significant first.

3
00:00:20.714 --> 00:00:25.830
Switch tabs to see the terms from another database.

4
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:31.221
The Genes column lists the predicted targets behind each term.

5
00:00:31.221 --> 00:00:40.016
The dotplot shows the top GO Biological Process terms: further right is more significant, a bigger dot means more genes.

6
00:00:40.016 --> 00:00:44.971
Re-run with a different cutoff at any time; the results are saved with the job.
